{"reviews":[{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-0","r":5.0,"t":"Fits over my dreads nice and comfortably!","x":"This product fits great! It is also pretty comfortable! I will definitely recommend!","h":31,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-1","r":4.0,"t":"Amazing product/Didn\u2019t get everything that was advertised.","x":"This is an amazing quality item. It fits snug, it holds down the hair nicely, and it\u2019s not too tight. There\u2019s not a time when I feel like it\u2019s gonna fall off. The material feels great and very sturdy as well and you can use two to get more compression. However, I recommend using a durag along with one of the caps. That way the elastic band doesn\u2019t feel too tight for some when using two caps. Meanwhile, while we are on the topic of durags, my order came with four caps instead of three caps and a ","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-2","r":2.0,"t":"Maybe it\u2019ll form fit over time","x":"Comfortable yes but for the purposes of being a \u201cWaver,\u201d these Durags and caps are unacceptable. This may be due to the material, which I must say does seem durable but it bunches up at the top close to the crown. This causes the fit to be off and you never get that \u201cSnug\u201d feel. This of course impacts the lay down of your waves. On a fresh cut and Murray\u2019s pomade (which I rarely use) after unragging my hair still looked frizzy. Which if you have waves you know isn\u2019t supposed to happen. I normall","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-3","r":4.0,"t":"Great for making waves","x":"I'm a pro waver and these silk caps are great for making and maintaining waves or any style you want to compress. The only issue is that they don't fit behind the ears and have to be pulled over the ears for maximum effectiveness. That irritates the ears after a few hours and make them hard to sleep in. Silk is the best way to maintain waves because they don't pull the hairs out of place like stocking caps (pro tip). I still wear these silk caps in between brushing sessions (I do two or three se","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-4","r":5.0,"t":"Fits as intended","x":"Just a change of pace form all the other headgear I own.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-5","r":5.0,"t":"Fits as intended","x":"Just a change of pace form all the other headgear I own.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-6","r":2.0,"t":"Unfitting for waves!","x":"Listen y\u2019all, you need a certain type of head to have this. It peels back off my head even though it\u2019s tight too! Waste of money in my opinion, ended up not using them. The colors are good, the thing is that it would hold down the front but not the back. I tried lifting and folding, but that\u2019ll end up falling off your head while you\u2019re sleeping. If you don\u2019t have a certain head for this, it simply isn\u2019t for your head for wave purposes!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-7","r":4.0,"t":"Almost Exactly What I Wanted","x":"Looking for something to cover my hair so my cpap headgear quits crimping the hair all over the place. Really tough to get it to \"calm\" down and lay right sometimes. This cap does keep my hair in place, BUT my big 'O head isn't very comfortable! Really need some bigger sizes made available. This one leaves a pretty good indent across my forehead that takes quite awhile to go away after getting up. The elastic band needs to be bigger! NOT the actual head covering piece...it's perfect! Breathable ","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-8","r":5.0,"t":"a little bit Pricey.","x":"I bought these Duarags for My son says he love Rags they fix him good also the caps he wants me to get him some more the only thing is I think it's a little pricey I'm still thinking about getting him because he wants the colorful ones. I","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great for keeping the braids tight.","x":"Just got my hair braided for the first time and everyone told me to buy a durag. I shot for these instead and they keep everything tight and perfect while I sleep, plus I keep it on when changing my shirt to avoid messing them up. Good compression, breathable. After 8 hours of wearing it slips off like nothing was ever there. Good buy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-10","r":1.0,"t":"Too tight and little","x":"Listen, I don\u2019t have the biggest noggin. But these are waaaaaaaay too small for the average adult head. If you have adolescents with hair, maybe this will work for them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-11","r":4.0,"t":"Really tight","x":"These fit really snug... aka tight. Some ppl like that, I on the other prefer if it wasn\u2019t so tight. The doo rag it came with is nice & I use it the most.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great for working out","x":"They are actually better than expected. I just don\u2019t like how it covers the ears. So I cut out a piece around it. I go between these and a durag","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-13","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t not buy .","x":"Would not recommend extremely tight had my head hurting writhin 5 mins disappointed because really wanted to find something for compression","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-14","r":1.0,"t":"Too tight","x":"This cap was too small for my head and too tight. It didn\u2019t fully cover my entire head. I wasted my money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-15","r":5.0,"t":"RECOMMEND","x":"Bought these for my husband, he loves them! Perfect fit, great material, wears them constantly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-16","r":1.0,"t":"Way too small!!!","x":"This is for a child's head!!!! Pictures of this product are very misleading!!! Never again!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great seller","x":"Not what I expected but they replaced it for free to satisfy me","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-18","r":1.0,"t":"Too small","x":"Way too small! These did not fit for a teenager or an adult.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-19","r":1.0,"t":"Small","x":"This caps are tiny. They only fit on the very top of my head","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-20","r":5.0,"t":"Good buy","x":"Boyfriend and son likes them just what we were looking for","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-21","r":1.0,"t":"Garbage","x":"These were a waste of money. Very unsatisfied","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-22","r":5.0,"t":"Quick and easy for those on the run.","x":"Granted, it doesn't take a ton of time to throw on a durag. But if you're really pinched for time, these come in handy. The elastic band works great and keeps a snug fit. I've also already washed these multiple times, and they are still in great condition. I would advise, with anything elastic, not to put it through a dryer so that it lasts longer. Overall, they are comfortable but not the top of the line. I'll definitely be buying more of these since they do save time and are good for on-the-ru","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-23","r":3.0,"t":"Not terrible but not great either","x":"The caps work but they are cut a little strange. They are short on 2 sides and long on the other sides. I have to cuff them to get them to fit properly which I don\u2019t really mind. They will NOT stay put on your head so be prepared to have to adjust them a lot","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08LMFDN1H-24","r":2.0,"t":"High quality but too tight","x":"Unfortunately, while the quality of these caps are great, they are much too tight by design. While some nights were more bearable than others, I found myself waking up with the cap off. If they were 20% bigger, or adjustable, they would be perfect.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the caps fit well and hold hair in place comfortably, though some note they can slip off after long wear.","cites":[1,2,5,6,10]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the caps run too tight or too small for average adult heads, with some finding them painful.","cites":[11,12,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the caps are effective for compression and maintaining waves or braids.","cites":[2,4,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers report fit problems like bunching at the crown or not holding the back of the head, making them unsuitable for waves.","cites":[3,7]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the caps cover or irritate the ears, requiring adjustments.","cites":[4,13]}]},"qa":[]}